{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"22":{"eng-name":"The Book of Fasting","ara-name":"كتاب الصيام"}},"section_detail":{"22":{"hadithnumber_first":2090,"hadithnumber_last":2434,"arabicnumber_first":2090,"arabicnumber_last":2434}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2265,"arabicnumber":2265,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Salamah : Lorsque le Messager d'Allah ﷺ prenait le petit-déjeuner à Marr Az-Zahran, et qu'Abu Bakr et 'Umar étaient avec lui, il a dit : \"(Venez prendre) le petit-déjeuner.\" (Daif) Il l'a rapporté sous forme Mursal","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":22,"hadith":176},"chapter":{"id":49,"ara-name":"باب ذِكْرِ اسْمِ الرَّجُلِ ","eng-name":"The Name of that Man","isFirstHadith":false}}]}